{"2879200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "End Them, Soldier!", "steam_appid": 2879200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/56791b00c22f322cce402b9c280bad72.avif?t=1769045194\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Them, Soldier! is a brutal, violent shooter inspired by 90’s legends. It’s all about constant pressure, unstoppable action and skill builds to eradicate demons, skeletons and other horrific creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 handcrafted campaign levels from retro streets under a bloody sky through crushing bunkers to the darkest dungeon. to learn builds/progression while you <strong>annihilate</strong> hordes of horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/0133470e2d469cb19bd998281c515691.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/0133470e2d469cb19bd998281c515691.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/0133470e2d469cb19bd998281c515691.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike mode </strong>on 36 arenas for endless build mastery and climbing a leaderboard <strong>split into 5 difficulty tiers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/0df065f213d54aea78a2c25cca651162.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/0df065f213d54aea78a2c25cca651162.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/0df065f213d54aea78a2c25cca651162.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 weapons</strong> for different styles and situations. <strong>7</strong> can evolve or get weird via skill builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/d277a3962a1d032f930fb13b3a55c539.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/d277a3962a1d032f930fb13b3a55c539.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/d277a3962a1d032f930fb13b3a55c539.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s inside:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra-hardcore.</strong> It’s tough. Constant pressure. Full focus + build mastery or you’re wasted.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/7aae6dca000fcd60d8a5cbd262af7be2.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/7aae6dca000fcd60d8a5cbd262af7be2.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/7aae6dca000fcd60d8a5cbd262af7be2.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Builds.</strong> Iterate, fail, iterate again. One level wants a brutal Shooting Axe, another needs freeze rockets, double shotgun, runic buffs. Adapt or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/d6628f330cf5e8169d1933321b8a7892.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/d6628f330cf5e8169d1933321b8a7892.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/d6628f330cf5e8169d1933321b8a7892.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Situational gameplay.</strong> Each level hands you certain weapons, you must adapt to what you’re given.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling challenge.</strong> Higher tiers = tighter movement, cleaner aim, smarter tailoring of builds. Not just more firepower.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level design.</strong> Minimal maze nonsense. Almost zero padding, action only.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/ca4cdeba66d5837b37c1b190afc19b70.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/ca4cdeba66d5837b37c1b190afc19b70.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/ca4cdeba66d5837b37c1b190afc19b70.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/56791b00c22f322cce402b9c280bad72.avif?t=1769045194\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End Them, Soldier! is a brutal, violent shooter inspired by 90’s legends. It’s all about constant pressure, unstoppable action and skill builds to eradicate demons, skeletons and other horrific creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24