ly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/ca4cdeba66d5837b37c1b190afc19b70.poster.avif?t=1769045194\" width=800 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/ca4cdeba66d5837b37c1b190afc19b70.webm?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/ca4cdeba66d5837b37c1b190afc19b70.mp4?t=1769045194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fast, brutal old‑school FPS with deep replayability through skill builds. Tailor specific builds with speed‑boost jumps, a burst‑fire explosive revolver, AXE SHOOTING as a shotgun and beyond in a handcrafted campaign, then climb the leaderboards in endless roguelike mode.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/d49a53efb37a55e0b3a38754c2cdb5e2ccf34a7a/header.jpg?t=1769045194", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/ff7807ea7058857c8d41f679fefb0a4a47af3729/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769045194", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/ff7807ea7058857c8d41f679fefb0a4a47af3729/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769045194", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I hope that this game will be able to launch even on a potato.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"